Third-party code in this directory
==================================

`extensions/chamfer_distance/` and `extensions/earth_movers_distance/` contain
CUDA/C++ sources derived from PCN (Yuan et al., 3DV 2018, MIT License),
https://github.com/wentaoyuan/pcn.

`models/pcn.py`, `metrics/`, `dataset_pc.py`, `train.py`, `pcn_train.py`,
`pcn_export.py` and `setup_ext.py` are re-implementations / adaptations written
for this benchmark, sharing the same public API as the upstream PCN code.

Upstream copyright and license: MIT. A copy of the MIT text is in the repository
root `LICENSE`. No modification of the upstream CUDA kernels was made beyond
build-script adaptation.
